{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10293200","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10293200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1029320001:1":{"text":"물을 뜨러 왔을 뿐인데, 이렇게 많은 몬스터와 마주칠 줄은 몰랐어요...","source_cn":"我只是出来取个水，没想到会遇到这么多魔物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DAB0BA2ED28BF82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029320002:1":{"text":"구해주셔서 감사합니다!","source_cn":"艾雅在上，感激诸位相救。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A9CB459C0240FE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029320003:1":{"text":"좋아요. 일이 순조롭게 해결됐으니, 이제 성석 도난 사건을 계속 조사해 볼까요? 아직 궁금한 게 엄청 많다고요!","source_cn":"好啦，既然事情已经顺利解决了，那我们是不是可以继续调查...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D2532EAAA7317BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029320004:1":{"text":"난 계속 어울려줄 생각 없다니까? 꼬마 아가씨.","source_cn":"我可没答应要继续配合你啊，小姑娘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x651FC873570224E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029320005:1":{"text":"여러분, 성석 도난 사건의 진실은 제가 아탈란테보다 더 잘 알고 있을지도 몰라요. 하지만 지금은 수도사들을 성석 마을까지 안전하게 데려다 주어야 해요.","source_cn":"各位，圣石失窃之后的事，比起阿塔兰忒，我或许更为了解。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9C380EDE725D176","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029320006:1":{"text":"그 이후에도 이 이야기를 알고 싶다면... 성석 마을에서 저를 찾아와 주세요.","source_cn":"在那之后，如果你们还想要了解这个故事的话……可以来圣石...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC16A761F11E7A77D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029320007:1":{"text":"테미히아, 사실 내가 계속해도 되는데...","source_cn":"特弥希娅，其实我可以继续——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x236CA5D60AF0A648","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029320008:1":{"text":"미안해요, 아탈란테. 이건 저도 물러설 수 없네요.","source_cn":"抱歉，阿塔兰忒。在这一点上，我坚持。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA71C233EB33BC505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029320009:1":{"text":"...그래.","source_cn":"……我明白了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABFA82D623652764","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029320010:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 성석 마을에서 뵙겠습니다.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3F6E98B4694326B6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 성석 마을에서 뵙겠습니다.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 성석 마을에서 뵙겠습니다.","